# words.pdl - image word bank (W0, claude, 2026-10-13). Plan: BOOK 16.game/WORD-BANK-TO-IMAGE.md. Words say how a thing LOOKS; the entity word bank (zz.wordbank) is a different thing (names and aliases).
# WORD | id | text | kind | weight        kind: subject material colour angle style size negative. weight 0..1: words under the cutoff (default 0.30) are left out of the prompt. Changing a weight is a candidate edit that a human promotes; a model never sets it.
